{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act47side_level_act47side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act47side",
  "stageId": "act47side_04",
  "title": "晴空湍流",
  "storyCode": "UR-4",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act47side/level_act47side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "458c049484dd5ce6f0e8a4e747200e2134bf890c160ae51c0caf46e20ba4f020",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "抱歉，我来晚了。今天的工作有些忙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的女声",
      "text": "梅、梅希亚......请你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的女声",
      "text": "我需要......想起，更多......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "您的情况很特殊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "您的记忆像是枯枝上仅存的败叶，拂去灰尘或许能令它们恢复些许色泽，但太过用力，只会造成伤害。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "我甚至不该去拨弄它们的，若不是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "抱歉，拂哀菈女士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拂哀菈",
      "text": "我需要......知道，需要......想起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "离开家乡之后的回忆对您来说并不愉快，但如果您坚持......那就闭上眼睛吧，我们继续尝试。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "有些费力地，梅希亚把她总带在身边的那台老旧的幻灯机搬上了桌子。\n随着她指尖滑动，玻璃幻灯片落入卡槽，一幅陌生的景象笼罩了女妖衰老的身躯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拂哀菈",
      "text": "......我记得，那个地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "莱塔尼亚？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拂哀菈",
      "text": "她......提过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拂哀菈",
      "text": "那里，高塔......镣铐，血。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "缓慢地，模糊地，一段记忆在幻灯机投射出的背景上晕开。梅希亚辨认出一具衰老的身躯被锁在墙边，几个穿着长袍的人影进进出出。\n一些血的气味，一段可怖的旋律，一些术式的痕迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "莱塔尼亚的高塔，您被囚禁在那里过？......作为实验对象？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "若不是一位巫妖出手相助，您几乎就要被埋葬在高塔术师的书页之下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "圣城的安魂教堂，您在那里为人送葬？是为您流落在外的同胞，还是为您族群的......仇敌？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "但那些天使并不领情，对吗？他们的葬礼上需要的是欢笑，而不是您的......哀哭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "您差点被戍卫队逮捕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "您来到哥伦比亚......是横穿了整片拓荒地，甚至......骸骨荒原？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "那片野兽都不敢踏足的、被风沙切割得千疮百孔的土地？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "您最后还是来到了这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "为什么，偏偏是这座园区？您是来寻找什么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拂哀菈",
      "text": "这里，这里也有......树。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拂哀菈",
      "text": "这里的树，也在枯萎、腐败......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拂哀菈",
      "text": "枯萎、腐败。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "原来如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "这里的确有一座生态园，它也确实刚刚发生过一场令人不忍注目的事故，枯萎、腐败，如您所说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "而那座生态园的主人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "是另一位女妖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "或许，您认识它吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那支在生态园酿成大祸，后来又被高登收缴的骨笔，就这样洁白无辜地躺在梅希亚的手中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拂哀菈",
      "text": "......她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拂哀菈",
      "text": "她的气息......她在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "所以，您是来找人的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拂哀菈",
      "text": "我想......我想见她......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费尔南",
      "text": "不用把身子压得这么低，奥克里，你背上的施术装置已经歪了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克里",
      "text": "这可是莱茵生命的地下通道，说不定连墙壁里都有纳米监听器！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克里",
      "text": "再说了，我们还要当心园区的报警系统......既然是帮高登长官办事，为什么还得躲着警卫队？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费尔南",
      "text": "你觉得有几个下属能得到他的完全信任？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克里",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费尔南",
      "text": "看电梯的小警卫都有可能是哪位大人物的第三只眼睛。要是出了岔子，牵扯出的问题可比这几箱违禁品严重得多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克里",
      "text": "所以我们这两个没有相关利益的外来人，反倒是替他“销赃”的最佳人选？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费尔南",
      "text": "没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费尔南",
      "text": "不过有一个问题我确实想不明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克里",
      "text": "什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费尔南",
      "text": "干活的人有了，接应的人也安排了，那躺在办公室里喂喂鳞兽听听小曲不是更好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费尔南",
      "text": "亲自过来监工可是会惹上麻烦的啊，长官？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高登",
      "text": "哼，我当然是来为我的小家伙们送行的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克里",
      "text": "什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高登",
      "text": "别随便乱晃，蠢货，源石技艺还原装置的保护壳差点就撞墙上了！我跟你们说过，要把这批货看得比自己的命还重。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克里",
      "text": "当然！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克里",
      "text": "那您也一定记得，要是我俩把这些“小家伙们”安全送出去，管好自己的嘴——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高登",
      "text": "我们的账一笔勾销。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克里",
      "text": "太好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高登",
      "text": "别掉以轻心。娜斯提不愿撤出生态园，宁愿面对满墙失败品也要继续研究，甚至昼夜不停。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费尔南",
      "text": "所以她现在就在我们的头顶上？我好像听到她的脚步声了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高登",
      "text": "不用担心，梅希亚会帮我们解决这个小问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高登",
      "text": "小梅，小梅！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "......啊，听得到，高登长官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高登",
      "text": "你那边怎么样？要是计划失败，就算是出面硬拖，也得把娜斯提拖住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "您放心，长官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "就是因为我的疏忽，所以才出了那么多意外......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "我一定会盯紧娜斯提主任，确保她离开莱茵生态园，为你们争取尽可能多的时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高登",
      "text": "很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高登",
      "text": "看看，关键时刻连小梅都变得靠谱起来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高登",
      "text": "你们俩给我上点心，快到运输口了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克里",
      "text": "知道了，长官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "费尔南小姐的听觉真是敏锐啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "梅希亚小姐，您的身份可能会暴露，需要我们以应急管理监督协会的身份出面干预吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "把梅兰德的招牌用在更重要的地方吧，高登长官的秘书是个很好用的幌子，我这里不用费心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "报告情况。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅兰德特工",
      "text": "根据二组白天收集到的情报，莱茵的技术人员确实撤出了实验区，只有娜斯提主任和一名助手出入这个场馆，只不过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "她待在这里的时间长到令人费解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅兰德特工",
      "text": "......是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅兰德特工",
      "text": "抱歉，作为您的小队成员，我们应该更信任您的判断，莱茵生命可能确实在展馆地下藏了什么东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "不用道歉，监视各家科技公司本来就是我的任务。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅兰德特工",
      "text": "如果我们要进一步搜查，娜斯提主任那边......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "放心，依我的计划，如果一切顺利，保守估计能为我们争取二十分钟的调查时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "text": "我准备了一份，她无法拒绝的礼物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯凯",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯凯",
      "text": "啊啊——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "text": "再来一次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯凯",
      "text": "娜斯提主任，生态园和浮空种植单元的程序就是用这套系统实现的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯凯",
      "text": "虽然隔空控制物体是女妖之所长，但放弃以声音作为媒介，将咒言封存在模块之中，依靠自循环修复漏洞，可是划时代的发明！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯凯",
      "text": "要是全由咒言驱动......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "text": "少看一些纯是猜想的论文，斯凯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯凯",
      "text": "包含我在内的大多数人对女妖的了解有限，我听说她们栖居在河谷之中，很少离开......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯凯",
      "text": "来哥伦比亚历练之前，你也待在那里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "text": "我最初的记忆来源于卡兹戴尔，后来我被同族收养，被带回了河谷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯凯",
      "text": "那是个怎样的地方？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "text": "与世无争的好地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "text": "河流边的草地和丛林茂密，花朵不败，果实不落。不说天灾，连雨水都极少侵扰它的安宁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯凯",
      "text": "既然如此，你为什么要走呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯凯",
      "text": "这么晚了，是谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯凯",
      "text": "主、主任，快过来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯凯",
      "text": "这是不是你丢的那支骨笔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "text": "是那支骨笔......的一部分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "娜斯提和斯凯脚边，被切断的锥形笔尖在地上来回滚动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯凯",
      "text": "太过分了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯凯",
      "text": "生态园的事故不是意外也不是谁的恶作剧，一切都是有备而来。针对你，或是针对莱茵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "text": "有一种方法可以把事情弄清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "text": "（萨卡兹语）指引。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "娜斯提手中的残片应咒言飘浮起来，莹白的光晕包裹着破碎的骨笔。锥形笔尖打转了几圈之后，向某个方向缓缓飞去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "text": "看来另一截骨笔离此不远。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯凯",
      "text": "主任......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "text": "这确实有可能是个圈套，但我有不得不去的理由。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "text": "这支骨笔上......有我熟悉的咒言的痕迹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
